{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-1","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · DSH 划词引用：在 DSH Web 的聊天里选中一段文字，点击「引用到输入框」，就能针对这段话继续提问，不用来回复制粘贴。\n\n输入框只显示一小段引用预览，发送时模型仍会收到完整原文。","source":"extracted","section":"DSH 划词引用"}
{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-2","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · 安装：适用于 DeepSeek Harness Web。当前已在 `@deepseek-ai/dsh` `0.1.0-rc.6` 上测试。\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-ui-quote-selection\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web`，再刷新浏览器。如果没有立即生效，可以按 Ctrl+Shift+R 强制刷新。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-3","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · 使用：1. 在用户或助手的消息中选中一段文字。\n2. 点击选区旁边的「引用到输入框」。\n3. 继续输入你想问的问题。\n4. 发送消息。\n\n输入框中的引用标签只显示原文开头，鼠标移上去可以查看引用内容，按退格键即可删除。你也可以在一条消息里加入多段引用（v0.1.1 起：按 detect 坐标追加 chip，修复第二段起引用失败）。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-4","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · 它做了什么：- 选中聊天文字后，一键放进输入框。\n- 输入框只显示简短预览，不会被长段原文占满。\n- 发送时自动带上完整原文，不会丢失内容。\n- 按钮文字会跟随 DSH 界面语言显示中文或英文。\n\n插件使用 DSH 自带的引用功能，不会修改 DSH 核心代码。","source":"extracted","section":"它做了什么"}
{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-5","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · 卸载：```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-ui-quote-selection\n```\n\n卸载后重启 `dsh web`。","source":"extracted","section":"卸载"}
{"unit_id":"nekogpt__dsh-ui-quote-selection#readme-6","repo":"nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection","commit":"c5034b4be26116bce5175e0db844b12ba8873828","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-quote-selection README · 从源码安装：```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection.git\ncd dsh-ui-quote-selection\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\n```\n\n主要实现位于 `lib/client.js`。DSH 仍处于快速开发阶段；升级 DSH 后，如果引用功能出现异常，请提交 [Issue](https://github.com/nekogpt/dsh-ui-quote-selection/issues)。","source":"extracted","section":"从源码安装"}
